{"seq":7,"slug":"cloud-computing","title":"高等职业教育云计算技术","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":11,"url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/cloud-computing","introMarkdown":"# 高等职业教育云计算技术\n\n我决定认真学云计算，是因为有一次帮朋友的小店上线一个在线点单页面。当时我用一台租来的虚拟服务器跑起来，结果中午高峰一来访问就卡死。我才意识到：原来\"服务器\"并不是机房里那台看得见摸得着的机器，而是一种可以随时按需要变多变少的能力。云计算想解决的，正是这种\"用多少要多少、不用就还回去\"的弹性问题。\n\n这本手册写给和我一样、从零开始摸索云计算的自学者。我不打算把它写成一门按部就班的大学课程，而是按照我自己踩坑、查资料、再动手验证的顺序来组织。每一节都尽量从一个具体的小问题出发，先讲清楚\"为什么会有这个东西\"，再讲\"它到底怎么用\"。\n\n整本手册分成四个部分。第一部分是云计算基础与虚拟化，搞清楚云到底是什么、IaaS / PaaS / SaaS 这些缩写背后的真实含义，以及支撑一切的虚拟化技术。第二部分走进主流云平台，认识 AWS、Azure、Google Cloud、阿里云这些玩家，以及它们提供的计算、存储、网络、数据库等核心服务。\n\n第三部分是这几年最热的容器与微服务，我们会从 Docker 入门，再到 Kubernetes 编排，最后理解微服务架构为什么会流行。第四部分回到运维与安全，因为应用上线只是开始，怎么监控、怎么自动化发布、怎么不被黑客攻破，才是长期要面对的事。\n\n技术更新很快。写作时（2026 年年中）Kubernetes 已经发布到 v1.36，WebAssembly 正在和容器并肩出现在生产环境，公有云市场仍由 AWS、Azure、Google Cloud 三家领跑。我会尽量标注这些时间点，但更重要的是帮你建立起不会过时的底层理解。\n\n学习方式上，我强烈建议边读边动手。云厂商基本都有免费额度，注册一个账号、开一台最小规格的机器、跑一个容器，远比反复读文档来得深刻。每节末尾我都留了练习与思考，希望你不要跳过。\n\n如果你完全没有运维或编程背景也别担心。我会把命令行、网络、Linux 这些前置知识用到的地方点到为止，遇到拦路的概念就停下来解释一下。我们慢慢来，一步一步把云这张网铺开。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cloud-fundamentals-virtualization","title":"云计算基础与虚拟化","docCount":3,"url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/cloud-computing/cloud-fundamentals-virtualization","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-cloud-computing","title":"什么是云计算","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/cloud-computing/cloud-fundamentals-virtualization/what-is-cloud-computing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"service-and-deployment-models","title":"服务模型与部署模型","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/cloud-computing/cloud-fundamentals-virtualization/service-and-deployment-models"},{"seq":3,"slug":"virtualization-technology","title":"虚拟化技术","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/cloud-computing/cloud-fundamentals-virtualization/virtualization-technology"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"cloud-platforms-services","title":"主流云平台与核心服务","docCount":3,"url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/cloud-computing/cloud-platforms-services","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"public-cloud-landscape","title":"主流公有云平台格局","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/cloud-computing/cloud-platforms-services/public-cloud-landscape"},{"seq":2,"slug":"compute-storage-network","title":"计算、存储与网络核心服务","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/cloud-computing/cloud-platforms-services/compute-storage-network"},{"seq":3,"slug":"databases-and-serverless","title":"托管数据库与无服务器","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/cloud-computing/cloud-platforms-services/databases-and-serverless"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"containers-microservices","title":"容器与微服务","docCount":3,"url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/cloud-computing/containers-microservices","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"docker-fundamentals","title":"Docker 基础","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/cloud-computing/containers-microservices/docker-fundamentals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"kubernetes-orchestration","title":"Kubernetes 容器编排","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/cloud-computing/containers-microservices/kubernetes-orchestration"},{"seq":3,"slug":"microservices-architecture","title":"微服务架构","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/cloud-computing/containers-microservices/microservices-architecture"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"cloud-ops-security","title":"云运维与安全","docCount":2,"url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/cloud-computing/cloud-ops-security","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"monitoring-and-cicd","title":"监控与持续交付","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/cloud-computing/cloud-ops-security/monitoring-and-cicd"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cloud-security-basics","title":"云安全基础","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/cloud-computing/cloud-ops-security/cloud-security-basics"}]}]}